     "text": "Your job search is personal.",
     "file": "C:\\Users\\Raven\\Desktop\\Projects\\DemoReel\\work\\job-explorer\\privacy-short\\voice\\52d56b36f02153a7.wav",
     "seconds": 1.5757916666666667
    },
    {
     "text": "Here's how Job Explorer keeps it that way.",
     "file": "C:\\Users\\Raven\\Desktop\\Projects\\DemoReel\\work\\job-explorer\\privacy-short\\voice\\a00f0e769d5f2796.wav",
     "seconds": 2.117583333333333
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "It can run its AI right on your computer, with Ollama.",
     "file": "C:\\Users\\Raven\\Desktop\\Projects\\DemoReel\\work\\job-explorer\\privacy-short\\voice\\6e42f876ccd2bf82.wav",
     "seconds": 2.9909166666666667
    },
    {
     "text": "Your resume never goes to an AI service, and it's free.",
     "file": "C:\\Users\\Raven\\Desktop\\Projects\\DemoReel\\work\\job-explorer\\privacy-short\\voice\\53b4d2244badc29f.wav",
     "seconds": 3.103875
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "Prefer a cloud AI?",
     "file": "C:\\Users\\Raven\\Desktop\\Projects\\DemoReel\\work\\job-explorer\\privacy-short\\voice\\a09cbf1551fbe767.wav",
     "seconds": 1.2169166666666666
    },
    {
     "text": "Your name, email, phone, and address are never sent to any AI.",
     "file": "C:\\Users\\Raven\\Desktop\\Projects\\DemoReel\\work\\job-explorer\\privacy-short\\voice\\913d0bb47e1b3bdf.wav",
     "seconds": 3.659375
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "Everything is stored encrypted, with a key your Windows sign-in protects.",
     "file": "C:\\Users\\Raven\\Desktop\\Projects\\DemoReel\\work\\job-explorer\\privacy-short\\voice\\49a37aaab02de893.wav",
     "seconds": 3.857666666666667
    },
    {
     "text": "There's no account, and nothing is sent to the app's maker.",
     "file": "C:\\Users\\Raven\\Desktop\\Projects\\DemoReel\\work\\job-explorer\\privacy-short\\voice\\a2c3ae1a68c5c966.wav",
     "seconds": 2.9427083333333335
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "Want a second lock?",
     "file": "C:\\Users\\Raven\\Desktop\\Projects\\DemoReel\\work\\job-explorer\\privacy-short\\voice\\0659d6292a5ad7ca.wav",
     "seconds": 1.128
    },
    {
     "text": "Turn on a master password, and nothing opens without it.",
     "file": "C:\\Users\\Raven\\Desktop\\Projects\\DemoReel\\work\\job-explorer\\privacy-short\\voice\\e83500b59c121679.wav",
     "seconds": 2.9978333333333333
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "lines": [
    {
